    "text": "By Fideri News Network report ,\n1 days ago Unlike a traditional shovel groundbreaking, the ceremony will feature a symbolic “sledgehammer” wall-breaking. Montgomery County is taking a major step forward in providing comprehensive behavioral health care with the groundbreaking of its new Emergency Behavioral Health Crisis Center. The first facility of its kind in Pennsylvania, the Center will offer 24/7 emergency behavioral health and substance use support for residents of all ages. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 9",
